// Choices: a plain option, a condition, @once, an empty body, bodies that fall through and that leave, and a nested choice.

== snap.choices
-> A plain option
    mira: Picked.
-> A conditional option  @if $has_key #thought
    mira: Has the key.
-> An option picked once  @once
    @set $count += 1
-> An empty body
-> A body that jumps
    mira: Going.
    @jump snap.elsewhere
-> A nested choice
    -> Inner one
        mira: One.
    -> Inner two
        @end
mira: After the choice.

== snap.elsewhere
mira: Here.
